            <i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles mr-1"></i> 點擊螢幕任意處 綻放浪漫心形與專屬祝福 <i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles ml-1"></i>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Customization Settings Modal -->
    <div id="settingsModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-30 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="glass-card w-full max-w-md p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl relative transform scale-90 transition-all duration-300 border border-rose-500/30">
            <!-- Close Button -->
            <button id="closeSettings" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-rose-300 hover:text-white p-2">
